---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactCard from '../components/ContactCard.jsx';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const logo = `${base}images/logo-forte-quimica.png`;
---
<BaseLayout>
<header class="bg-white shadow-sm"><nav aria-label="Navegação principal" class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl items-center justify-between gap-6 px-5 py-3 lg:px-8"><a href="#inicio" aria-label="Forte Química Polibom, início"><img src={logo} alt="Forte Química Polibom" width="160" height="132" class="h-18 w-auto object-contain"/></a><div class="hidden items-center gap-8 font-semibold text-[#123a63] md:flex"><a href="#inicio" class="hover:text-[#38a91e]">Início</a><a href="#sobre" class="hover:text-[#38a91e]">Sobre nós</a><a href="#horarios" class="hover:text-[#38a91e]">Horários</a><a href={`${base}blog/`} class="hover:text-[#38a91e]">Blog</a><a href="#contato" class="hover:text-[#38a91e]">Contato</a></div><a href="#localizacao" class="rounded-full bg-[#42b820] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-[#329d18]">Onde comprar</a></nav></header>
<main id="inicio">
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#e9f8ff] via-white to-[#effbea]"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 -top-32 size-[480px] rounded-full border-[80px] border-[#29a7e8]/10"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-56 -left-36 size-[500px] rounded-full border-[75px] border-[#42bb24]/10"></div><div class="relative mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-5 py-20 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-8 lg:py-28"><div><p class="mb-5 inline-flex rounded-full bg-[#dff5d8] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#219429]">Qualidade • Economia • Eficiência</p><h1 class="max-w-xl text-5xl font-extrabold leading-[1.08] tracking-tight text-[#082c50] sm:text-6xl">A força da limpeza para o seu dia a dia.</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-lg text-lg leading-8 text-[#48617a]">Produtos de limpeza de alta performance com o cuidado, o rendimento e a economia que você procura.</p><p class="mt-4 font-bold italic text-[#159b43]">O barato da limpeza.</p><div class="mt-9"><ContactCard /></div></div><div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[520px]"><div class="absolute inset-6 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#48c9ec]/25 to-[#45bf2e]/25 blur-3xl"></div><div class="relative rounded-[2rem] border border-white bg-white/85 p-8 shadow-[0_25px_80px_#07549b1f] sm:p-12"><img src={logo} alt="Logotipo colorido da Forte Química Polibom, com gota azul e formas verdes" width="1024" height="1024" class="mx-auto w-full object-contain" fetchpriority="high"/></div></div></div></section>
<section id="sobre" class="bg-white px-5 py-20 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center"><div><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-[#37a425]">Sobre nós</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#082c50] sm:text-5xl">Limpeza com mais resultado.</h2><p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-[#50667a]">Na Forte Química Polibom, você encontra produtos de limpeza de alta performance. Nossa proposta é simples: reunir qualidade, economia e eficiência para facilitar sua rotina.</p></div><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">{['Qualidade','Economia','Eficiência'].map((item,i)=><article class="rounded-3xl border border-[#dceef5] bg-[#f7fcff] p-6"><span class="text-sm font-bold text-[#30a5d9]">0{i+1}</span><h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold text-[#0b3b69]">{item}</h3></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section id="horarios" class="bg-[#eef8fc] px-5 py-20 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-[#36a421]">Planeje sua visita</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#082c50] sm:text-5xl">Horário de atendimento</h2><div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-[#cde6f2] bg-white p-7 shadow-sm"><p class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#0b61ae]">Segunda a sábado</p><p class="mt-3 text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#0b3d7b]">8h às 19h</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-[#d5ebc8] bg-white p-7 shadow-sm"><p class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#34a523]">Domingo</p><p class="mt-3 text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#248d2a]">9h às 12h</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="bg-white px-5 py-20 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-7 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><div><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-[#36a421]">Dicas e cuidados</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#082c50]">Conheça nosso blog</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-[#50667a]">Conteúdos sobre organização e cuidados para uma rotina de limpeza mais prática.</p></div><a href={`${base}blog/`} class="button-primary self-start sm:self-auto">Ler artigos <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
<section id="contato" class="bg-[#082c50] px-5 py-20 text-white lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 md:grid-cols-2"><div><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-[#65ce44]">Fale com a gente</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold sm:text-5xl">Visite ou entre em contato.</h2><p class="mt-5 text-lg text-white/75">Rua Ernesto Casara, 945<br/>Bairro Kaiser</p><a href="tel:+5554996306905" class="mt-4 inline-block text-xl font-bold hover:text-[#65ce44]">(54) 99630-6905</a><div class="mt-8"><ContactCard light /></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-white p-8"><img src={logo} alt="Forte Química Polibom — O barato da limpeza" width="1024" height="1024" class="max-h-64 w-auto object-contain" loading="lazy"/></div></div></section>
<section id="localizacao" class="bg-white px-5 py-20 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-center"><div><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-[#36a421]">Onde comprar</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#082c50] sm:text-5xl">Encontre a Forte Química.</h2><p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-[#50667a]">Rua Ernesto Casara, 945<br/>Bairro Kaiser</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="https://share.google/bs95eL0bHxtmfuZDo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button-primary" aria-label="Abrir a localização da Forte Química Polibom no Google Maps">Abrir no Google Maps <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="https://www.waze.com/ul?ll=-29.18973300313056%2C-51.19656257274597&amp;navigate=yes" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button-outline" aria-label="Iniciar rota para a Forte Química Polibom no Waze">Ir pelo Waze <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-[#dceef5] shadow-[0_18px_50px_#07549b1a]"><iframe title="Mapa da Forte Química Polibom na Rua Ernesto Casara, 945" src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=-29.18973300313056,-51.19656257274597&z=16&output=embed" width="100%" height="390" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" style="border:0;display:block" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div></section>
</main><footer class="bg-[#06233f] px-5 py-6 text-sm text-white/65"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-3 text-center sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:text-left"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Forte Química Polibom. O barato da limpeza.</span><a href="https://www.dibr3.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white/50 transition-colors hover:text-white" aria-label="Site de quem desenvolveu o projeto, dibr3.com">Desenvolvido por dibr3.com</a></div></footer>
</BaseLayout>
